  "title": "The Checklist Remembers the Quiet Step",
  "family": "learning",
  "category": "work/process",
  "premise": "A recurring export must include subtitles, but the dramatic animation work distracts the operator from the final accessibility check. A short checklist puts the overlooked step at the point of export.",
  "hook": "Which small step disappears when the big work feels done?",
  "visible_action": "An export lever pauses beside three checkboxes; the subtitle preview opens before the lever completes its path.",
  "intended_takeaway_or_theme": "A checklist can make a repeatable, easily forgotten step visible at the right moment.",
  "gate": "Keep the checklist specific; checking a box alone does not verify subtitle quality.",
